      "content": "we tried bumping it up to 205c and increasing the time to 50 seconds, but the patches are still there. it's weird because the pressure seems consistent across the whole plate. could it be something with the ink itself or maybe the way the heat is distributed? it almost feels like certain parts of the print are just... disappearing during the process.",
