    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "we checked the ink batches and they seem fine, and the heat distribution looks okay on the thermal readings. it's just so random though. like, sometimes the color gets there, but then a few minutes later or on the next sheet, it's just gone in those same spots. it's like the ink is being actively messed with or something. any other technical reasons why color would just vanish like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
